WEBVTT

1
00:00:10.667 --> 00:00:18.476
Danny: You big bully!

2
00:00:18.477 --> 00:00:20.780
Tina: Danny, are you okay?

3
00:00:20.781 --> 00:00:23.059
Danny: His hand is so cold.

4
00:00:23.060 --> 00:00:25.884
Brad: Maybe there is no life in him.

5
00:00:25.885 --> 00:00:28.644
This is not good.

6
00:00:28.645 --> 00:00:30.824
Tina: What are we going to do now?

7
00:00:30.825 --> 00:00:38.684
Brad: I think we’re surrounded.

8
00:00:38.685 --> 00:00:40.838
Danny: What’s Bello doing?

9
00:00:40.839 --> 00:00:43.174
Brad: He’s bringing us the art supplies.

10
00:00:43.175 --> 00:00:45.636
Tina: He’ll get captured again!

11
00:00:45.637 --> 00:00:57.493
All three: Bello, no! Stay back!

12
00:00:57.494 --> 00:00:59.427
Bello: He-he!

13
00:00:59.428 --> 00:01:01.520
Danny: Do you see what I see?

14
00:01:01.521 --> 00:01:05.370
Brad: They’re scared of color!

15
00:01:05.371 --> 00:01:09.175
Tina: Good boy, Bello. You saved us.

16
00:01:09.176 --> 00:01:10.988
Bello: Good boy!

17
00:01:10.989 --> 00:01:16.700
Brad: Oh, this is going to be fun.

18
00:01:16.701 --> 00:01:18.315
Danny: Are we ready?

19
00:01:18.316 --> 00:01:20.506
Tina: Ready, willing . . .

20
00:01:20.507 --> 00:01:22.727
Brad: . . . and able.

21
00:01:22.728 --> 00:01:28.871
Danny: Start your art project!

22
00:01:28.872 --> 00:01:31.434
Danny: That’s very artistic, Tina.

23
00:01:31.435 --> 00:01:32.956
Tina: Thank you.

24
00:01:32.957 --> 00:01:44.231
Brad: I think you could get an A from Mr. Smith.

25
00:01:44.232 --> 00:01:47.033
Tina: Look, that one’s going crazy!

26
00:01:47.034 --> 00:01:52.360
Brad: Something’s happening to him!

27
00:01:52.361 --> 00:01:55.169
Danny: The paint melted him into nothing.

28
00:01:55.170 --> 00:01:59.470
Brad: You guys are in big trouble now!

29
00:01:59.471 --> 00:02:05.713
Danny: Hey, bad guy. Catch!

30
00:02:05.714 --> 00:02:10.821
Brad: Danny, watch this!

31
00:02:10.822 --> 00:02:16.464
Tina: Good one, Brad!

32
00:02:16.465 --> 00:02:17.817
Bello: Circles.

33
00:02:17.818 --> 00:02:19.598
Danny: Ready, Tina.

34
00:02:19.599 --> 00:02:26.781
Tina: Ready, aim, fire!

35
00:02:26.782 --> 00:02:28.899
Brad: Right on target.

36
00:02:28.900 --> 00:02:31.371
Danny: Okay. Playtime is over.

37
00:02:31.372 --> 00:02:39.823
Let’s finish them off!

38
00:02:39.824 --> 00:02:41.838
Tina: We did it!

39
00:02:41.839 --> 00:02:43.248
Brad: All right!

40
00:02:43.249 --> 00:02:50.045
Tina: High five!
